{"id":"n71354-2-3","stage":2,"title":"아이고 · 哎呀","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71354-2-3-1","ko":"아이고, 어서 오너라. 밖에 춥지?","zh":"哎呀，快进来吧。外面很冷吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이고,","meaning":"哎呀","explanation":"아이고：哎呀","readings":[{"term":"아이고","audio":"/audio/0d494eb3dbdffe834856.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71354","senseId":"2","lemma":"아이고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이고","audio":"/audio/0d494eb3dbdffe834856.mp3"}},{"text":"어서","meaning":"请，快","explanation":"어서：请，快","readings":[{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67026","senseId":"2","lemma":"어서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}},{"text":"오너라.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；너라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오너라","audio":"/audio/83dc43be2d2f8fd850a7.mp3"}},{"text":"밖에","meaning":"表示只有前面内容所示的状态或行为方法。","explanation":"밖：表示只有前面内容所示的状态或行为方法。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"5","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖에","audio":"/audio/b49faf879a59fe63a605.mp3"}},{"text":"춥지?","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"2","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"춥지","audio":"/audio/16c469a1914a0654725e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0d494eb3dbdffe83","term":"아이고","zh":"哎呀","audio":"/audio/0d494eb3dbdffe834856.mp3","entryId":"71354","definition":"感到高兴或喜悦时不知如何是好而发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아이고"]},{"id":"596b9885ad